{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 46,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER046.YBC",
      "sha256": "dc07ef2aeff069043379f4c37ef7ae5eed81878fcb57e22051f696d9355eec22",
      "text_count": 45,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 114,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "《真的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 142,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            1,
            2
          ],
          "text": "　真的只在短短的時間裡，\n　老師他……》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 168,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "《就讓純潔之盾回到了這白皙的城砦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 196,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            4,
            5
          ],
          "text": "　這就是，\n　名列學舍十傑的賢者能力嗎。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 234,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            6,
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "《最早的時候，是由我父德涅西亞領導，\n　在他親切的庇護、以及優秀的指導下，\n　黃金時代來臨……》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 266,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            9,
            10
          ],
          "text": "《而純潔之盾十六將之一的「黃昏之月」－\n　奧爾菲‧羅馬諾華接任管理了五年。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 298,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "《繼承了先前的傳統，\n　以一貫的溫柔與慈愛包容著孩子們。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 320,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "　而我能夠瞭解。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 348,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15
          ],
          "text": "　他們兩位將這一切托付的對象，\n　他那高貴的心與深沉的眼神。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 380,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "《那位先生所表現出來的強烈思念，\n　究竟是什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 402,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "　那強烈的思念讓我受到了很大的震撼，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 430,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            19,
            20
          ],
          "text": "　是的，那是與校長一樣的，\n　深沉的，濃厚的慈愛。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 456,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "《然而，到底該說那是一種幸福還是恐懼呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 478,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "　……我感覺十分地恐懼。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 510,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            23,
            24
          ],
          "text": "《無論我們是否希望，\n　純潔之盾也將被領導向更高的境界。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 538,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            25,
            26
          ],
          "text": "　在這無盡的苦難之後，\n　無論是誰也都背負著無法逃脫的命運。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 576,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            27,
            28,
            29
          ],
          "text": "《奧吉爾，甚至是羅沙麗亞，\n　也在苦惱，也在嘆息。\n　然後在黑闇中孤獨地前進。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 604,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            30,
            31
          ],
          "text": "　……年紀還小的那些孩子們呀，\n　能夠承受得住這種壓力嗎？》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 636,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            32,
            33
          ],
          "text": "《緩緩地，然而也確實地，\n　就連這鐵三角也崩潰了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 658,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "　現在，純潔之盾的腳步又還能夠多快呢。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 696,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            35,
            36,
            37
          ],
          "text": "《連讓疲勞身體休息的時間也沒有，\n　硬是要將他們帶往更高境界的時候，\n　如果沒有穩固的基礎的話……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 724,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            38,
            39
          ],
          "text": "　雖然我瞭解這樣的道理，然而在這個時候，\n　我是否也應該以笑容去守護他們呢？》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 750,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "不……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 778,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            41,
            42
          ],
          "text": "相信他的判斷，以及支撐這些孩子們，\n是我必須完成的任務。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 800,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "而那也正是守護故鄉的任務。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 46,
          "source_offset": 822,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "這一切，也就只是這樣了。"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 47,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER047.YBC",
      "sha256": "e3ff2ce302186d4cc3e791bf9bd5133318a195b1f954379e4f4f062c917454fe",
      "text_count": 42,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 206,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 228,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "希里鄔司‧謬斯要來這裡的消息是真的嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 290,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            2,
            3,
            4,
            5,
            6
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，終於……\n貝爾鐸可勞的世家，\n謬斯大公殿下也要有動作了，\n準備一下吧，\n我們對他的接待至少也不能太輕率。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 336,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8,
            9
          ],
          "text": "那信上的簽名當然要弄清楚是否屬實，\n不，也許那應該說是我們得弄清楚他的本意究\n竟是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 364,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            10,
            11
          ],
          "text": "那有可能是可以原諒的，\n也有可能是不可原諒的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 402,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            12,
            13,
            14
          ],
          "text": "雖然可以確認這件事情的真偽，\n但卻不代表可以解開所有的謎團，\n可是我們仍然得去確認，是嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 428,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 454,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 510,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            17,
            18
          ],
          "text": "從一開始我就認為，\n他不可能是會送來那種信的人。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 544,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "艾爾雪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 578,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "也許他正受到了很大的壓力與痛苦吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 600,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "我是這麼想的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 622,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 644,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 684,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "如果他真的是為了要讓我們臣服，\n而送了那封信過來的話……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 712,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            26,
            27
          ],
          "text": "應該要在純潔之盾回到安蒂米昂之前，\n就動手才對吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 738,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "……的確。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 760,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 790,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "我很想知道他們的目的究竟是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 828,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            31,
            32,
            33
          ],
          "text": "好。\n那剛好，其實呢，\n對方指名了要妳跟他們交涉。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 862,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "咦？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 906,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            35,
            36,
            37,
            38
          ],
          "text": "雖然我對沒辦法跟他們交談而感到遺憾……\n但是也許對他們來說，\n重要的並不是我這個賢者吧。\n帕彌菈。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 932,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 47,
          "source_offset": 956,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            40,
            41
          ],
          "text": "與貝爾鐸可勞的大公殿下的會面，\n就交給妳負責了。"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
