    {
      "chapter": 235,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER235.YBC",
      "sha256": "e6c1e1d8ef23e14c25625ebc33733101bd0d0e65214940f60da3cc3d8fdc4412",
      "text_count": 28,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 98,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "我說啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 136,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 168,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            2,
            3
          ],
          "text": "讓它在這裡變成安蒂米昂的名產，\n好像也不錯嘛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 194,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 232,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            5,
            6,
            7
          ],
          "text": "本來呀，我是想早一點……\n是啊，如果在艾爾貝洛瓦就可以這樣做的話，\n說不定會更有趣呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 258,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "如果不是在這裡的話，就沒有這種餘裕了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 284,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "……抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 316,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            10,
            11
          ],
          "text": "在有能力做的時候就全力去做，\n這的確是伊諾森提雅的傳統沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 348,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            12,
            13
          ],
          "text": "原來如此。\n不過……你離開愛爾梅納斯也有九年了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 370,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 398,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            15,
            16
          ],
          "text": "我呀，只不過是被關在牢裡那麼一小段時間，\n就已經被整成這樣了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 424,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 468,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19,
            20,
            21
          ],
          "text": "就憑這一點，\n我能夠瞭解奈比洛斯閣下敢於保持沉默，\n甚至到自己還因此被囚禁的程度……\n那就表示她已經有了相當大的覺悟。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 494,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 532,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            23,
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "唉呀，總之咧，\n「那個」已經在第三中庭裡準備好了，\n什麼時候想試試看都可以。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 235,
          "source_offset": 564,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            26,
            27
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。\n謝謝你。"
